  "details": "As the title says.\n\nFor example, when we receive a group announcement notification, the menu icon (hamburger icon) changes to the group's icon.\n\nThis makes it difficult to recognize that the item is meant to open the menu.\n\nThe menu icon shouldn't change based on the notification; it should be displayed as a separate item.\n\nHowever, it would be good to make this a selectable option for users who prefer the current, compact design.",
